{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19日の握手会、体調不良により欠席になってしまいすみませんでした(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかく来てくれた方には、本当に申し訳ない気持ちでいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、もう体調も回復して元気になりましたのでご安心を！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスから帰ってきてから、MステやMUSIC DAY、横浜個別、収録などなど色々あったよ(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mステは二回目の出演でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/22/9097241/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また出られて本当に嬉しいですし、生放送はやっぱり緊張します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タモリさんは優しくてとても素敵な方です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなタモリさんに毎シングル会いたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また次も呼んで頂けるように、今後も頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜個別は、ジャケットでも着たTシャツを着たよ(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/22/9097241/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のデザイン、正直恥ずかしい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも着るなら堂々と着よう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしくなんかないさ！そうさ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを着ればいつでも白石が一緒だ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒だから着やすいと思う！さ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポジティブポジティブ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の幕張握手会は全身黒！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/22/9097241/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"格好が黒だったからなのか、黒石さん？ってほとんどの人に聞かれたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいや違いますって。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかですね、最近、黒石さんに推し変する人多くて悲しい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白石も見捨てないであげてね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中、優里の生誕祭に参加！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真を撮って見守ってました(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/22/9097241/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣き顔も可愛いゆっちゃん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めてお誕生日おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも元気で意外としっかり者の優里が大好きだよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとゆっちゃんだけのマイホーム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21歳もたくさん笑わせてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も乃木ピクミン。(詳しくは優里ブログへ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引っこ抜かれました(⌒▽⌒)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/22/9097241/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、昨日でれなりんの卒業。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約三年間、一緒に活動してきた仲間がまた一人と卒業していくのは寂しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんとは初期からたくさん話したり顔面パイ一緒にしたり、まいのすけって呼んでくれたり、学業との両立で大変なのにいつも笑顔でパワフルな姿を見て凄いなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目指す道が違うだけで、卒業しても、ずっとずっとこれからも変わらず同じ一期生の仲間だからね！れなりん大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までお疲れ様！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/22/9097241/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメでも言いましたが、今日から少しの間仕事の都合でブログとモバメ更新できなくなると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アディオス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/22/9097241/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p